  <para unique="1046162" format="05_FigureFrame">
   <string>VPERM2F128 Operation</string></para>
  <para unique="1046163">
   <string>Imm8[1:0] select the source for the first destination 128-bit field, imm8[5:4] select the source for the second destination field. If imm8[3] is set, the low 128-bit field is zeroed. If imm8[7] is set, the high 128-bit field is zeroed.</string></para>
  <para unique="1046164">
   <string>VEX.L must be 1, otherwise the instruction will #UD.</string></para>
  </longdesc>
